N:Listen: Thomas Mapfumo and the Blacks Unlimited — "Shumba", from Gwindingwi Rine Shumba (1981), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=feOyfEeK3LE. Hear electric guitar and bass take interlocking cyclical roles associated with mbira-informed chimurenga sound.
N:Thomas Mapfumo's chimurenga music connects Shona musical resources with anticolonial and post-independence political expression. This new 6/4 exercise is not chimurenga.
N:Original pitches, harmony and rhythmic cells; no mbira-derived guitar line, lyric or arrangement from the recording is copied.
