N:Listen: Ali Farka Touré with Ry Cooder — "Ai Du", from the album Talking Timbuktu, World Circuit, 1994, https://music.apple.com/us/song/ai-du-with-ry-cooder-with-ry-cooder/1528519981. Hear voice and guitar converse, repeated modal ground, subtle rhythmic displacement and the space between phrases.
N:Ali Farka Touré's music grows from Malian/Songhai traditions and a personal relationship with blues heard across the Atlantic. This original Dorian study is not "desert blues" repertoire.
